# Full-resolution photo drops staged in the repo root. The web-sized crops that
# the dashboard actually serves live in assets/photos/ and ARE tracked; these
# multi-megabyte originals are not, so a stray `git add -A` cannot publish them.
/*.JPG
/*.jpg
/*.jpeg
/*.png
/*.webp
